bcom:source-1377ef9b1255a2087416aa311826974f630af64b9b914f3782346eefe66ce5d0 bco:departureNote "IOF lets any independent continuant bear a capability, with artifacts (a lathe, a sensor) as its examples. The BCO adopts IOF's disposition placement but restricts the bearer of a Business Capability to an Organization (CD1); the register lists IOF among the bearer departures (SF-05)."@en .
bcom:source-1377ef9b1255a2087416aa311826974f630af64b9b914f3782346eefe66ce5d0 bco:locator "IOF Core release 202603, Core.rdf: capability of / has capability, whose bearer is any independent continuant (BFO_0000004)" .
bcom:source-1377ef9b1255a2087416aa311826974f630af64b9b914f3782346eefe66ce5d0 bco:relation "departs-from" .

bcom:source-1b83e95baaf4fcf3c5bb03bbe0f037e11f654a82f6a0dbb8dc0ec32989f37fbd bco:citesClaim "1"^^xsd:integer .
bcom:source-1b83e95baaf4fcf3c5bb03bbe0f037e11f654a82f6a0dbb8dc0ec32989f37fbd bco:citesSource bcos:SRC-OMG-01 .
bcom:source-1b83e95baaf4fcf3c5bb03bbe0f037e11f654a82f6a0dbb8dc0ec32989f37fbd bco:departureNote "VDML lets individual Actors, human or machine, provide capabilities alongside OrgUnits. The BCO restricts the bearer to an Organization (CD1); an Actor's ability is classified as something else (a person's skill, or an artifact's function), not as a Business Capability."@en .
bcom:source-1b83e95baaf4fcf3c5bb03bbe0f037e11f654a82f6a0dbb8dc0ec32989f37fbd bco:locator "VDML 1.1, section 7.1.7 (Actors in OrgUnit Positions provide Capabilities) and section 7.1.9 (an Actor may fill the Role that provides a required Capability)" .
bcom:source-1b83e95baaf4fcf3c5bb03bbe0f037e11f654a82f6a0dbb8dc0ec32989f37fbd bco:relation "departs-from" .

