bcom:source-b4310d58f06cffb00b852d22036d6e6d0caa8869b96d96d4c9e97689f9a25cb1 bco:departureNote "Homonym. CMMI capability levels rate performance in one practice area, and maturity levels describe the organization across a set of practice areas; both rate how work is performed. A Capability Maturity Rating ranks an Organization Capability instance on a stated scale and prescribes no scale or scoring method."@en .
