bcom:source-ecd0737bc7b05197415a7f6723d550064d40833d26a7fd961514f6949afd1561 bco:departureNote "The UFO line puts maturity inside the capability, as a quality (the capability level) inhering in it. In BFO a specifically dependent continuant inheres only in an independent continuant, so the BCO makes the rating an Ordinal Measurement ICE about the capability instance instead (register SF-12)."@en .
